OL,3,ATwo in court over alleged Iran-linked
OL,4,Aplot at RAF Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FNouman Essghir, also 24 and from
OL,7,FWestminster, has been charged with
OL,8,Fentering a prohibited place for a
OL,9,Fpurpose prejudicial to the UK on 22
OL,10,FAugust - weeks before he was arrested
OL,11,Fnear the airbase in Gloucestershire
OL,12,Falongside four other men.
OL,14,FThe pair appeared at Westminster
OL,15,FMagistrates' Court on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
